### REST Client — S9.3 Claude Code para infraestructura.
### Parser requisitos + prompts canónicos + audit checker.

@host = http://localhost:5115

### Salud
GET {{host}}/health

### Parsear requisitos: multi-region + GDPR + autoscale + MI
POST {{host}}/infra/requisitos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "descripcion": "API REST con App Service (HTTPS only) y Managed Identity, Cosmos DB serverless, Service Bus, Key Vault. Multi-region (West Europe + North Europe). Compliance GDPR. Auto-scale con slots staging y production." }

### Parsear requisitos minimalistas (genera avisos)
POST {{host}}/infra/requisitos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "descripcion": "Quiero una web app y storage" }

### Prompt canónico: Bicep desde requirements
GET {{host}}/infra/prompt/BicepDesdeRequirements

### Prompt canónico: Dockerfile multi-stage
GET {{host}}/infra/prompt/DockerfileMultiStage

### Prompt canónico: reverse ARM→Bicep
GET {{host}}/infra/prompt/ReverseArmABicep

### Audit: web app sin HTTPS, storage público, TLS 1.0
POST {{host}}/infra/audit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recursos": [
    {
      "nombre": "app-ventas-prod",
      "tipo": "Microsoft.Web/sites",
      "httpsOnly": false,
      "tieneManagedIdentity": false,
      "tieneTags": true,
      "tlsVersion": "1.0"
    },
    {
      "nombre": "stventasprod",
      "tipo": "Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts",
      "accesoPublico": true,
      "tieneTags": false
    }
  ]
}

### Plan + checklist completo
POST {{host}}/infra/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descripcion": "API REST .NET 10 con App Service + Cosmos DB + Service Bus + Key Vault. HTTPS only, Managed Identity, slots, auto-scale. Multi-region UE (GDPR).",
  "recursos": [
    {
      "nombre": "app-ventas-prod",
      "tipo": "Microsoft.Web/sites",
      "httpsOnly": true,
      "tieneManagedIdentity": true,
      "tieneTags": true,
      "tlsVersion": "1.2"
    }
  ]
}
